# Everything that must not reach a public image.
.git
.probe
.shots
.verify
tests
*.md
!CREDITS.md
serve.py
serve.sh
docker/Dockerfile
docker/docker-compose.yml
.dockerignore
# docker/nginx.conf must stay in the build context (it is COPYd to
# /etc/nginx/conf.d), so that one file is not ignored — and nothing copies the
# docker/ directory into the served root.

# The 320 MB of source models these lines used to exclude were deleted from the
# repository on 2026-09-05: their textures had already been extracted into
# assets/textures, and nothing loaded the originals. Their license.txt files
# were kept, in assets/licenses/, because they are the attribution evidence for
# textures that ARE shipped. assets/ is now ~54 MB and every file in it is
# either loaded by the app or a licence. See CREDITS.md.
